SABR support (src/core/sabr/**, protos/sabr/**)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The SABR protocol buffer definitions under `protos/sabr/` were taken verbatim
from SmartTube, at:

    exoplayer-amzn-2.10.6/library/sabr/src/main/proto/sabr/

The TypeScript implementation under `src/core/sabr/` is a port of the Java
implementation in the same library:

    UmpDecoder.ts   ← parser/ump/UMPDecoder.java, parser/ump/UMPPartId.java
    SabrProcessor.ts ← parser/SabrProcessor.java
    SabrStream.ts    ← parser/SabrStream.java,
                       manifest/SabrManifest.java#createVideoPlaybackAbrRequest

